WEBVTT

00:00:27.214 --> 00:00:30.507
There are differing accounts
of what actually happened that afternoon,

00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:32.819
but since my sister is not
here with us today,

00:00:32.843 --> 00:00:34.739
let me tell you the true story --

00:00:34.763 --> 00:00:35.976
(Laughter)

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.435
which is my sister's a little
on the clumsy side.

00:00:38.459 --> 00:00:41.481
Somehow, without any help or push
from her older brother at all,

00:00:41.505 --> 00:00:43.975
Amy disappeared
off of the top of the bunk bed

00:00:43.999 --> 00:00:45.929
and landed with this crash on the floor.

00:00:45.953 --> 00:00:47.967
I nervously peered
over the side of the bed

00:00:47.991 --> 00:00:49.976
to see what had befallen my fallen sister

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.854
and saw that she had landed
painfully on her hands and knees

00:00:52.878 --> 00:00:54.229
on all fours on the ground.

00:00:54.253 --> 00:00:56.729
I was nervous because
my parents had charged me

00:00:56.753 --> 00:00:58.615
with making sure that my sister and I

00:00:58.639 --> 00:01:00.976
played as safely
and as quietly as possible.